{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Evil Crops",
    "steam_appid": 3379640,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/d90a4da433cce009d413324ff55e9c7c.poster.avif?t=1745370356\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/d90a4da433cce009d413324ff55e9c7c.webm?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/d90a4da433cce009d413324ff55e9c7c.mp4?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the great harvest! Evil Crops is a roguelike-like dungeon crawler where you fight against an ensemble of corrupted vegetables in order to save your farm! Construct your own bespoke weapons, gather loots and upgrades, unlock new areas, and have yourself a field day with this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/c5a7547f18dcb18bdc4e6d1dbc511326.poster.avif?t=1745370356\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/c5a7547f18dcb18bdc4e6d1dbc511326.webm?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/c5a7547f18dcb18bdc4e6d1dbc511326.mp4?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the procedurally-generated dungeons, you'll find enemies of various types and difficulties. From silly and mostly-harmless tomatoes to tricky and spicy pumpkins. Learn their different attacks, roll around and weed them off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/0936fa267e088a958918f5f3b6ba3023.poster.avif?t=1745370356\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/0936fa267e088a958918f5f3b6ba3023.webm?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/0936fa267e088a958918f5f3b6ba3023.mp4?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, you have to take matters into your own hands \u2013 and being a farmer is no walk in the park! Collect vegetable aspects and craft your own guns the way you like it: mix and match different aspects for a unique firing experience, or stick to a single plant to maximize its unique potential!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/a220c30c3ced74840f72be27ac025150.poster.avif?t=1745370356\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/a220c30c3ced74840f72be27ac025150.webm?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/a220c30c3ced74840f72be27ac025150.mp4?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You reap what you sow, and with enough crops defeated you're bound to have a bounty! Clear an entire area and be rewarded with a unique item to help you along the game; or gather seed coins as you progress through the dungeons, then spend them wisely in the friendly not-so-scarecrow's shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/446b0f1a8be5aa9addb3c4510ad0562a.poster.avif?t=1745370356\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/446b0f1a8be5aa9addb3c4510ad0562a.webm?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/446b0f1a8be5aa9addb3c4510ad0562a.mp4?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is much to see beyond the fences! Unlock and explore brand new biomes after defeating each boss, and discover many new sinister vegetables \u2013 and their unique aspects!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/d90a4da433cce009d413324ff55e9c7c.poster.avif?t=1745370356\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/d90a4da433cce009d413324ff55e9c7c.webm?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/d90a4da433cce009d413324ff55e9c7c.mp4?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the great harvest! Evil Crops is a roguelike-like dungeon crawler where you fight against an ensemble of corrupted vegetables in order to save your farm! Construct your own bespoke weapons, gather loots and upgrades, unlock new areas, and have yourself a field day with this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/c5a7547f18dcb18bdc4e6d1dbc511326.poster.avif?t=1745370356\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/c5a7547f18dcb18bdc4e6d1dbc511326.webm?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/c5a7547f18dcb18bdc4e6d1dbc511326.mp4?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the procedurally-generated dungeons, you'll find enemies of various types and difficulties. From silly and mostly-harmless tomatoes to tricky and spicy pumpkins. Learn their different attacks, roll around and weed them off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/0936fa267e088a958918f5f3b6ba3023.poster.avif?t=1745370356\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/0936fa267e088a958918f5f3b6ba3023.webm?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/0936fa267e088a958918f5f3b6ba3023.mp4?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, you have to take matters into your own hands \u2013 and being a farmer is no walk in the park! Collect vegetable aspects and craft your own guns the way you like it: mix and match different aspects for a unique firing experience, or stick to a single plant to maximize its unique potential!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/a220c30c3ced74840f72be27ac025150.poster.avif?t=1745370356\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/a220c30c3ced74840f72be27ac025150.webm?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/a220c30c3ced74840f72be27ac025150.mp4?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You reap what you sow, and with enough crops defeated you're bound to have a bounty! Clear an entire area and be rewarded with a unique item to help you along the game; or gather seed coins as you progress through the dungeons, then spend them wisely in the friendly not-so-scarecrow's shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/446b0f1a8be5aa9addb3c4510ad0562a.poster.avif?t=1745370356\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/446b0f1a8be5aa9addb3c4510ad0562a.webm?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379640/extras/446b0f1a8be5aa9addb3c4510ad0562a.mp4?t=1745370356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is much to see beyond the fences! Unlock and explore brand new biomes after defeating each boss, and discover many new sinister vegetables \u2013 and their unique aspects!</p>",
